  "name": "Expense Message Decomposition Assistant",
  "description": "The Expense User Message Interpreter Agent processes user instructions related to expenses and determines the appropriate actions to perform.\n\nGiven a user message, the agent:\n\n- Combines the message with the existing conversation context\n\n- Decomposes the instruction into meaningful components\n\n- Identifies the user’s intent and expected outcome\n\n- Suggests the relevant action and target fields within the message",
